  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v10 (2.4.0) - Expression Tree Engine\n\n### What's New\n- **Full Expression Tree compilation** - Entire mapping plan compiled to IL at first use, zero reflection in hot path\n- **15x+ performance improvement** - Complex mappings now ~17μs vs ~270μs in V9\n- **Pass-through complex mapping** - Complex destination properties auto-instantiated when nested properties have [BindTo] attributes\n- **Fluent nested path support** - Nested destination paths (e.g., \"DestinationTest2.Name\") now work correctly\n- **Smart cycle detection** - Type-level cycles detected at build time; runtime uses (source, destType) pairs\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed InvalidCastException when same types mapped with different generic contexts\n- Fixed cache key collision issues with new (RuntimeSrc, Dest, DeclaredSrc) tuple keys",
